":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":10,"created_at":"2025-08-25T21:51:44Z","updated_at":"2025-10-22T20:11:23Z","closed_at":"2025-10-22T00:16:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109971","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109971.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-22T00:16:39Z"},"body":"Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86098\r\nFixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106282\r\nCloses: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7878\r\n\r\nThis took a bit of refactoring. Originally we selected a 3D framebuffer format based purely on whether we were in the mobile renderer or the Forward+ renderer. For the 2D framebuffer, we selected based on the presence of the HDR2D setting. \r\n\r\nThis created a strange incompatibility when using glow with HDR2D with the mobile renderer. Your 2D content would be rendered in HDR. Then copied into an LDR framebuffer. Then copied back to HDR with glow applied. \r\n\r\nWhile there is a theoretical benefit to using an LDR framebuffer in 3D (especially when using glow), it just isn't compatiblity with 2D HDR. It is much better quality-wise to keep everything in HDR from beginning to end. \r\n\r\nThe biggest change is that we now look to the RenderBuffers class to determine if we should use an HDR format and whether we need to use a luminance multiplier. The RenderBuffers are automatically recreated if we switch to HDR, so this ensures that every part of the pipeline uses the same settings. \r\n\r\nReflections and sky still use LDR always since they can be shared between several Viewports and not all viewports necessarily have the same HDR2D setting. In the future we may want to consider making ReflectionProbes and Sky always use HDR. But that decision is out of scope for this PR. ","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109971/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109971/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}